{"3917600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tempered Hue", "steam_appid": 3917600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tragedy has befallen Ambyth, and you’re the town’s only hope! In Tempered Hue you’ll run the local Blacksmith’s Shop and mine for rare resources, all while building relationships, tackling enemies, and scaling the vast caverns of the town’ s towering escarpment. Find survivors, restore Ambyth, and root out the source of a looming curse. Your time has come, apprentice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Blacksmith’s Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.poster.avif?t=1779755306\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.webm?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.mp4?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the town’s only blacksmith, locals and visitors alike will come to you in search of common goods and unique gifts. Forge a variety of items in your workshop, then use them to earn coin in your shopfront, or deliver orders to your neighbours, to strengthen bonds and unlock new recipes and questlines. Riches await those who devote themselves to a shopkeep’s life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cavern Delving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.poster.avif?t=1779755306\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.webm?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.mp4?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To craft anything, you’ll need to travel into the caverns of the nearby escarpment. Explore its unique environments to mine and forage, with various metals, flora, and fauna awaiting discovery. Upgrade your tools to gather higher tier resources, and scale the heights of the caverns to find unique items, lost townsfolk, and uncover mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forging Friendships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.poster.avif?t=1779755306\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.webm?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.mp4?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Ambyth in disarray, its townsfolk need your help. Finding survivors will unlock new questlines, and deeper connections can unlock new recipes and bonuses when like becomes love. Be aware, however, that connections existed before you in Ambyth. A friendship with one person could find you at odds with another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visiting Towns (Multiplayer)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.poster.avif?t=1779755306\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.webm?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.mp4?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome up to three friends to your version of Ambyth, or sail to visit theirs. The escarpment’s layouts are unique to each player’s game, so your friend’s caves will differ greatly from your own. Share discoveries and build memories beyond the main storyline: encounter new ‘townsfolk’, find rare recipes, and spend big at your friends’ blacksmith shops (or make a hearty profit). Adventures are best enjoyed with company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tragedy has befallen Ambyth, and you’re the town’s only hope! In Tempered Hue you’ll run the local Blacksmith’s Shop and mine for rare resources, all while building relationships, tackling enemies, and scaling the vast caverns of the town’ s towering escarpment. Find survivors, restore Ambyth, and root out the source of a looming curse. Your time has come, apprentice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Blacksmith’s Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.poster.avif?t=1779755306\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.webm?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.mp4?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the town’s only blacksmith, locals and visitors alike will come to you in search of common goods and unique gifts. Forge a variety of items in your workshop, then use them to earn coin in your shopfront, or deliver orders to your neighbours, to strengthen bonds and unlock new recipes and questlines. Riches await those who devote themselves to a shopkeep’s life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cavern Delving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.poster.avif?t=1779755306\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.webm?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.mp4?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To craft anything, you’ll need to travel into the caverns of the nearby escarpment. Explore its unique environments to mine and forage, with various metals, flora, and fauna awaiting discovery. Upgrade your tools to gather higher tier resources, and scale the heights of the caverns to find unique items, lost townsfolk, and uncover mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forging Friendships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.poster.avif?t=1779755306\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.webm?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.mp4?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Ambyth in disarray, its townsfolk need your help. Finding survivors will unlock new questlines, and deeper connections can unlock new recipes and bonuses when like becomes love. Be aware, however, that connections existed before you in Ambyth. A friendship with one person could find you at odds with another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visiting Towns (Multiplayer)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.poster.avif?t=1779755306\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.webm?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.mp4?t=1779755306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome up to three friends to your version of Ambyth, or sail to visit theirs. The escarpment’s layouts are unique to each player’s game, so your friend’s caves will differ greatly from your own. Share discoveries and build memories beyond the main storyline: encounter new ‘townsfolk’, find rare recipes, and spend big at your friends’ blacksmith shops (or make a hearty profit). Adventures are best enjoyed with company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Tempered Hue is a third-person grim-cozy game about running a blacksmith shop. Craft unique tools and items, sell your wares, and explore local caverns to gather crafting materials. Navigate treacherous caverns with your trusty grappler alone or with friends in this blacksmith slice of life sim.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/978e88f605c9b9db43ab441a689ef7fb13a264c8/header.jpg?t=1779755306", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/37e0703d9c8052966104f82a2685e717021c6c3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779755306", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/37e0703d9c8052966104f82a2685e717021c6c3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779755306", "website": "https://zugalu.com/our-games/tempered-hue/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Zen 2 4c/8t, 2.4-3.5GHz (up to 448 GFlops FP32)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 RDNA 2 CUs, 1.6GHz (1.6 TFlops FP32)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Game is still in development, system requirements may change</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "©2025 Zugalu Ltd.. All rights reserved. Sovereign Syndicate is a registered trademark of Crimson Herring Studios Inc.", "developers": ["Zugalu